  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Sectorial Winterization Assistance through Cash to Earthquake-affected Community in Ad&#x131;yaman, Turkiye</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to address immediate, multi-sectorial winterization needs of earthquake-affected vulnerable populations in Adiyaman, Turkiye. STL will provide winterization assistance using multi-purpose cash assistance (MPCA) methodology to 400 HHs (2,400 persons) in approximately 11 container or informal sites in city centre, &#xc7;elikhan, G&#xf6;lba&#x15f;&#x131;, Besni ve Tut districts and villages of Adiyaman province, in earthquake-affected Southeast Turkiye.</narrative>
  </description>
